      "height": 48.75,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "A 401 is replayed exactly once, never in a loop. Refresh is single-flight because the API sets\nROTATE_REFRESH_TOKENS=True: spending the same refresh token twice would invalidate a live session, so\nconcurrent 401s must share one refresh call.",
      "originalText": "A 401 is replayed exactly once, never in a loop. Refresh is single-flight because the API sets\nROTATE_REFRESH_TOKENS=True: spending the same refresh token twice would invalidate a live session, so\nconcurrent 401s must share one refresh call.",
